        "filing_date": "2026-06-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also provide application and installation design review services, evaluating customers' proposed configurations against our technical requirements across all critical parameters, electrical interconnection, load profile, fuel type and pressure, cooling airflow, and exhaust routing.",
        "start_character": 29868,
        "end_character": 30153
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-077817",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-077817-08ae3b85151387ef",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-077817",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe our nearly four decades of microturbine development, our installed base of over 10,800 units across 89 countries, our proprietary air bearing technology, and our global distribution and service infrastructure represent a durable competitive advantage that is difficult to replicate.",
        "start_character": 44741,
        "end_character": 45034
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-077817",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-077817-08ae3b85151387ef",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-077817",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We continue to evaluate and implement new systems designed to provide improved quality, reliability, service, greater efficiency, and lower supply chain costs.",
        "start_character": 52874,
        "end_character": 53033
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-077817",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-077817-08ae3b85151387ef",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-077817",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We focused our engineering efforts on coordinating our product design and manufacturing processes to bring our products to market in a cost-effective, reliable and timely manner.",
        "start_character": 55863,
        "end_character": 56041
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-077817",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-077817-08ae3b85151387ef",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-077817",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Each distributor operates as an extension of the Capstone brand, and we invest meaningfully in their training, certification, and commercial development to ensure consistent quality and performance standards globally.",
        "start_character": 27697,
        "end_character": 27914
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-077817",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-077817-08ae3b85151387ef",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-077817",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "For Fiscal 2026, we will be dedicating resources to complete other global grid certifications, especially in markets such as Australia and Italy, as well as developing new controls for our C65 to achieve UL1741 SB certification and complement the C1000 family.",
        "start_character": 57765,
        "end_character": 58025
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-077817",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-077817-08ae3b85151387ef",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-077817",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "For nearly four decades, we have developed and refined oil-free, friction free microturbine-based power generation technology that delivers world class low emissions and industry-leading uptime/availability in a \"plug and play\" design with low maintenance intervals that run on a broad range of gaseous fuels flexibility.",
        "start_character": 275,
        "end_character": 596
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-077817",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-077817-08ae3b85151387ef",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-077817",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-25",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "However, rules, regulations, laws and incentives could also provide an advantage to our distributed generation solutions as compared with competing technologies if we are able to achieve required compliance in a lower cost, more efficient manner.",
        "start_character": 48287,
        "end_character": 48533
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-077817",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-077817-08ae3b85151387ef",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-077817",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Revenue in the European region was negatively impacted in Fiscal 2026 as a result of the ongoing conflict and its broader economic consequences across the region and we continue to monitor developments closely.",
        "start_character": 37966,
        "end_character": 38176
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-077817",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-077817-08ae3b85151387ef",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-077817",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are affected not only by energy policies, laws, regulations, tariffs and incentives of governments in the markets in which we sell, but also by rules, regulations and costs imposed by utilities.",
        "start_character": 47112,
        "end_character": 47309
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-077817",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-077817-08ae3b85151387ef",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-077817",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are focused on improving our supply chain effectiveness, strengthening our manufacturing processes, and increasing operational efficiencies within our organization.",
        "start_character": 51877,
        "end_character": 52044
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-077817",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-077817-08ae3b85151387ef",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-077817",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We continue to evaluate opportunities in non-sanctioned markets such as Kazakhstan and Uzbekistan, where oil and gas development remains active, in full compliance with all applicable laws and export regulations.",
        "start_character": 37753,
        "end_character": 37965
      }
